@code{math-rir} segments a measured Room Impulse Response into
direct sound + early reflections using SSIR (Spatial Segmentation of
Impulse Response), based on Pawlak & Lee (2026). It powers reflection
analysis in the RoomEQ workflow.

@menu
* math-rir User Guide::
